### Upload un PDF
POST {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/72e9ca45-7cb3-4b03-9f60-f9c4e1292ea8/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="request"
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Document technique DT49"}
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="dt49.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< /Users/jean/Desktop/dt49.pdf
--boundary--

### Upload un DOCX
POST {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="request"
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Document de test"}
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< /Users/jean/Desktop/test.docx
--boundary--

### Upload un TXT
POST {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="request"
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Notes de test"}
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Contenu de test pour le fichier texte.
--boundary--

### Modifier le nom d'un document
PUT {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/58277d76-89a6-4dcc-9aff-45fa7924127e/documents/5f68ca41-5f88-47e2-a0cd-66aa4a1314b1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Nouveau nom du document"}

### Lister les documents d'un workspace (paginé)
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/58277d76-89a6-4dcc-9aff-45fa7924127e/documents?page=0&size=10&sort=filename,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lister les documents filtrés par extension
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/58277d76-89a6-4dcc-9aff-45fa7924127e/documents?extension=pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lister les documents filtrés par statut
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/58277d76-89a6-4dcc-9aff-45fa7924127e/documents?status=INDEXED
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lister les documents filtrés par content type
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/58277d76-89a6-4dcc-9aff-45fa7924127e/documents?contentType=application/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lister avec plusieurs filtres combinés
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/58277d76-89a6-4dcc-9aff-45fa7924127e/documents?extension=pdf&status=INDEXED
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Consulter un document par ID
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/58277d76-89a6-4dcc-9aff-45fa7924127e/documents/5f68ca41-5f88-47e2-a0cd-66aa4a1314b1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Télécharger un document
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/58277d76-89a6-4dcc-9aff-45fa7924127e/documents/5f68ca41-5f88-47e2-a0cd-66aa4a1314b1/download
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Supprimer un document
DELETE {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/58277d76-89a6-4dcc-9aff-45fa7924127e/documents/58277d76-89a6-4dcc-9aff-45fa7924127e
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### SSE — écouter les événements de statut des documents
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/58277d76-89a6-4dcc-9aff-45fa7924127e/documents/ingestion-events
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: text/event-stream
